Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: first eight-frame transparent full-body animation sheet for CANCEL CITY Big Bald Energy CC064, ability One Punch One Coupon. Image1 is the authoritative current card style and face; image2 only establishes whole-body suit, cape, boots, coupon and grocery-bag construction.
Exactly EIGHT whole intact full-body figures on a PORTRAIT2:3 canvas, TWO COLUMNS by FOUR ROWS. Row-major order. Each full bald head, cape, boots, hands, paper and bag safely INSIDE its own equal cell. Clear transparent gutters separating every silhouette and broad outer margins. Smaller figures preferred over clipping. Same scale and3/4 view facing screen-right.
Character LOCK: egg-shaped bald adult hero head, peach freckled/stippled skin, small pursed mouth, tiny pupils under extremely bored half-closed droopy eyelids, absurdly unimpressed face. Slightly oversized caricature head consistent with the existing actor, not realistic anatomy or a cute baby. Bright mustard-yellow fitted jumpsuit with silver front zip, black belt and round gold buckle, long RED shiny gauntlet gloves and RED knee-high boots, long slightly dirty WHITE cape attached by two circular BLACK shoulder clasps. One brown grocery bag with leek/carrot/greens hangs securely from left elbow; bag always attached, not floating. One small blank TAN perforated-edge rectangular coupon, NO markings or text.
Style: official card's very dense harsh scratched black etching, stippling, crosshatching, ugly expressive grotesque humor, acid-neon accent outlines. Not polished anime, clean cel art, vector, smooth illustration,3D or photorealistic.
Eight poses left-to-right every row:
1 bored loose readiness, right hand low, left hand holds coupon near chest while bag hangs from left elbow;
2 notices a sale offscreen-right, eyes widen slightly and head turns;
3 checks blank coupon closer with left hand, skeptical eyebrow;
4 holds coupon near his face, head tilts in intense bored inspection;
5 hopeful little upward glance, coupon still left, right hand starts curling into fist;
6 slowly places feet into fighting stance, left coupon held safely near chest, right fist halfway back;
7 slow reluctant punch windup, right fist draws to hip, knees slightly bend, half-closed bored eyes;
8 paused full anticipation, right fist pulled behind waist and body rotated slightly, left coupon forward at chest, still utterly deadpan.
Actor and connected held coupon/bag only. No shockwave, speed lines, stars, debris, smoke, particles, detached body part, separate fist, background, ground, shadow, sale sign, lettering, numbers, icons, logos, card frame or watermark. Actual alpha transparency around all8 figures.

attack:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: eight sequential WHOLE-BODY poses of ONE single punch, transparent sprite sheet, CANCEL CITY Big Bald Energy CC064. Image1 defines exact gritty scratched card style; image2 establishes same identity, costume, proportions and props. Continue precisely this hero, no redesign.
PORTRAIT2:3 sheet with exactly TWO COLUMNS and FOUR ROWS, eight equal generous cells, row-major. One complete intact hero in every cell, each whole bald head, cape, both boots, punch arm, fist, coupon and grocery bag visible and not cut off. Wide clear transparent gutters and outside margins. Avoid large figure scale; complete body is mandatory.
Hero: slightly oversized bald egg head, freckled peach skin, utterly unimpressed half-closed droopy eyes and tiny pursed mouth, broad deadpan caricature as in reference. Mustard-yellow jumpsuit silverfrontzip, blackbeltgoldroundbuckle, long red shiny gauntlet gloves, red tall boots, white dirty cape with two round black clasps. Left glove securely holds small BLANK TAN perforated-edge coupon near chest, brown grocery bag with leek/carrot/greens attached to left elbow throughout. RIGHT arm throws the single punch. Exact same cape/suit/gloves/face, harsh dense scratched etching, crosshatching and stippling, ugly neon-edged card illustration, never polished anime or clean vector.
Eight incremental frames of a SINGLE punch, read left-to-right each row:
1 anticipation: knees bent, right fist fully pulled behind hip, torso twisted;
2 forward movement starts: right elbow leaves hip, weight shifts toward front foot;
3 right fist halfway forward, elbow still bent, cape lags backward;
4 near contact: punch extends toward viewer-right at45degrees, fist foreshortened larger but connected wrist, forearm and upper arm clearly visible;
5 CONTACT POSTURE: oversized foreshortened red fist in foreground, continuous visible right arm joins fist back to shoulder; complete whole head/torso/legs behind it, fist no larger than one third of total figure height;
6 maximum followthrough: right arm fully extended screen-right, body leans behind punch, boring half-closed expression;
7 recoil: right elbow begins bending back, knees straighten slightly;
8 recovery: right fist returns low near hip, shoulders relax, still holding coupon and grocery bag securely with left.
All8 are whole-body figures, not hand-only closeups. Keep every visible limb naturally attached, exactly2arms2legs per hero. NO separate fist, detached hand, afterimage, clone, hit target, impact burst, shockwave, speedline, debris, paper effect, smoke, ground, shadow, background, lettering, coupon text, watermark, logo or card frame. True alpha background.

